cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "foucault-pendulum: Foucault pendulum simulation with fourth-order Runge-Kutta"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/shahabahreini/foucault-pendulum"
url: "https://shahabahreini.com/projects/foucault-pendulum/"
abstract: >-
  A C++17 solver and Python analysis tools for the Foucault pendulum in the Earth-fixed
  frame. Fourth-order Runge-Kutta integrates the Coriolis-coupled equations of motion,
  and the swing-plane precession is checked against the closed-form solution and the
  analytic period (sidereal day divided by sin of latitude).
keywords:
  - Foucault pendulum
  - Coriolis force
  - Earth rotation
  - Runge-Kutta
  - computational physics
  - numerical simulation
authors:
  - family-names: Bahreini Jangjoo
    given-names: Shahab
    website: "https://shahabahreini.com"
